(517, '100 Persen Manusia Film Festival', '100-persen-manusia-film-festival', 'Lainnya', 'FESTIVAL FILM 100% MANUSIA is a film festival which prioritises issues in human rights, diversity, encompassing gender and HIV/AIDS. This film festival aims to promote awareness on a wide range of these issues and create platforms of opening, sharing and exchanging creativities. We believe in unboxing all individuals from labels, stereotypes, prejudices, and negative stigmas. Our first film festival is held from September 22nd to October 1st, 2017.', NULL, NULL, '2017-09-21 17:00:00', '2017-10-01 16:59:59', 'https://infoscreening.id/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/100-persen-manusia-film-festival-2017.jpg', 'http://100persenmanusia.com/', 1, '2026-11-07 11:31:10', '2026-11-07 11:31:10', 3402),
