(608, 'Engcarnation UI 2018 proudly presents:  Movie Screening "Marlina the Murderer in Four Acts"', 'engcarnation-ui-2018-proudly-presents-movie-screening-marlina-the-murderer-in-four-acts', 'Lainnya', '[ARE YOU READY FOR MOVIE DISCUSSION?]

Greetings, Ladies and Gentleman!

Gender has always been a problematic ideological battleground in movies, but how exactly does this product of popular culture contribute in all this?

🔉Engcarnation UI 2018 proudly presents:

Movie Screening "Marlina the Murderer in Four Acts" and the discussion that come afterwards on ''Power Relations between Men and Women in "Marlina"''.

💬We will be bringing

Rama Adi, producer and co-writer,

Adriana Rahajeng, M.Si, lecturer in Race, Gender & Social Relations from Faculty of Humanities UI,

and it will be moderated by Ajeng Sharfina, S.Hum

Hesitate no more and join the discussion on April 9, 2018 at Auditorium Building X, 3rd Floor, Fakultas Ilmu Pengetahuan Budaya UI Depok.

💌It is free! 💌

Need further information? Please contact Tria (line: edriana/081282963960)

See you on the discussion!

