(643, 'Redsight Films and Two Island Digital: Movie Screening & Discussion', 'redsight-films-and-two-island-digital-movie-screening-discussion', 'Lainnya', 'Redsight Films and Two Island Digital, in association with Paviliun 28 and Sinema Rabu, proudly presents a screening & discussion session that will be held on May 30th, 2018.

Presenting the works by Jeiji Joned, Marsha Pusung, Wisnu Surya Pratama, Mark Olsen & Nick Calpakdjian through each of their respective films : "Sandal", "A Message From the Outer Space", "Papa Pulang" and "Songbird".

See you on Paviliun 28!', NULL, NULL, '2018-05-30 12:00:00', '2018-05-30 14:00:00', 'https://infoscreening.id/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/IMG-20180525-WA0010.jpg', NULL, 1, '2026-11-07 11:31:11', '2026-11-07 11:31:11', 4778),
(644, 'Sinemafeminis: Labor of Love', 'sinemafeminis-labor-of-love', 'Lainnya', 'The UN recently reports that women do 2.6 times the amount of unpaid care and domestic work that men do. These activities range from cooking, cleaning, to raising children. Aren’t those works? What differentiates male chefs with our mothers preparing our food at home? Why are women expected to do chores at the expense of themselves for free?

To reflect on all the invisible domestic labor that we often take for granted (or we women do voluntarily), the fourth session of Sinema Feminis will deal with unpaid labor as one of the invisible issues in the labor movement. Come and watch “The Second Mother” (2015) by Anna Muylaert with us and have an interesting discussion afterward about the way feminine socialization conditions women into doing unpaid works.

Date: Friday, 1 June 2018

Venue: Kenobi Space.

Movie: The Second Mother (2015)

Schedule:
14.00 - 16.00 : Movie screening
16.00 - 17.30 : Discussion with Qory Dellasera (Samuha Yoni) and Anastasia Sijabat (Jakarta Cinema Club)

Topic: Labor of Love

