(952, 'Cine Club IIC Jakarta 2016 "La Strada", Film by Federico Fellini', 'cine-club-iic-jakarta-2016-la-strada-film-federico-fellini-2', 'Lainnya', 'When Gelsomina (Giulietta Masina), a naïve young woman, is purchased from her impoverished mother by brutish circus strongman Zampanò (Anthony Quinn) to be his wife and partner, she loyally endures her husband''s coldness and abuse as they travel the Italian countryside performing together.

