(1053, 'Plaza Indonesia Film Festival - Love Philosophy', 'plaza-indonesia-film-festival-love-philosophy-2', 'Lainnya', 'Plaza Indonesia Film Festival
22-24 February 2017
Love Philosophy

This February, Plaza Indonesia Film Festival will present the art of love through six diverse movies.

Plaza Indonesia Film Festival proudly present *The Red Turtle*,winner of  Cannes Film Festival, the first animation feature movie that we screen in our festival. We also present special movies from Indonesia, *Salawaku* and *Ziarah* as a national premiere, and *Bukaan 8* as a new release movie.  There will be discussions after the screening with the cast and crew of these three special Indonesian features.

And don''t miss *Sing Street* from Ireland and *One Wild Moment* from France that remind us about being young and in love when the musics and stories are trully magical.

Let''s celebrate this month of love !

Book your ticket at
