♦#spartabroadcast', NULL, NULL, '2018-05-07 17:00:00', '2018-05-09 16:59:59', 'https://infoscreening.id/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/1525190308201.jpg', NULL, 1, '2026-11-07 11:31:17', '2026-11-07 11:31:17', 15746),
(1816, 'Layar Lokal: Pemutaran Film Pendek dan Diskusi bersama Andra Fembriarto', 'layar-lokal-pemutaran-film-pendek-dan-diskusi-bersama-andra-fembriarto-2', 'Lainnya', 'Andra Fembriarto is a very versatile filmmaker. From creating comedy to Sci-Fi fantasy film, he can do it all. He has won the Piala Citra for his short film "Pohon Penghujan" (2013) and created a popular web-series about traveling titled "Jalan-Jalan Men" for Malesbanget.com.

Despite of the variation of his works, one thing is always implemented in his works, his huge interest in Indonesian history and culture. Thus for his latest short film, Cayasukma (soon will be called Lehak and part of an Omnibus), Andra combines his passion for Indonesian culture and mystical fantasy. Let''s watch two of his short films, Cayasukma (2017) & Pohon Penghujan (2013) and also discuss the process of creating the stories and films with the director himself!

Location: Kenobi Space, Jl. Kemang Raya no. 6. Gedung Colony lantai 6
Date: Wednesday, 9 Mei 2018
Time: 19.30pm
